">>> register_shape(\"myshape\", s)\n"
">>> shape(\"myshape\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1565
msgid ""
"The :class:`Shape` class is used internally by the :func:`register_shape` "
"method in different ways.  The application programmer has to deal with the "
